BT /F1 16.00 Tf 0.1216 0.2275 0.3725 rg 56.693 762.520 Td (Sewing guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 0.4000 0.4000 0.4000 rg 56.693 737.008 Td (EU38  .  3 pieces  .  0.6 m fabric at 140 cm wide) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 0.4000 0.4000 0.4000 rg 56.693 717.165 Td (text-first guide, no illustrations in this edition. Every step is the engine's own instruction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13.00 Tf 0.1216 0.2275 0.3725 rg 56.693 683.150 Td (Cut list) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 660.472 Td (Front - cut 1 on fold) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 644.598 Td (Back - cut 1 on fold) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 628.724 Td (Waistband - cut 2, interface 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 13.00 Tf 0.1216 0.2275 0.3725 rg 56.693 590.173 Td (Construction order) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 567.496 Td (1. Print the pattern and check the 3 cm calibration square with a ruler before cutting anything.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 544.819 Td (2. Fold your fabric and cut the front and back on the fold. Cut 2 waistband pieces, interface 1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 522.142 Td (3. Sew any darts first, pressing them toward the center.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 499.465 Td (4. Stitch the side seams \(1.5 cm seam allowance\), leaving the top 20 cm of the left seam open for the zipper.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 476.787 Td (5. Insert an invisible zipper in the left seam: install the zipper BEFORE closing the seam below it, then close) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 460.913 Td (the seam.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 438.236 Td (6. Attach the interfaced waistband, right sides together, then fold and topstitch or hand-finish the inside.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 415.559 Td (7. Try it on. Adjust side seams if needed, then finish the hem with a 2 cm double-fold.) Tj ET

endstream
